/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500274 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186499844 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500274 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "ecc71117-bad7-5cf6-bbde-8b45ac8873de" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500293 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186500274 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500293 #edb/ref 1069 "q-126173" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500293 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500293 #edb/ref 1071 "Given that the random variable $X$ has the cumulative distribution function\n\n$$\nF(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}0, & x<0 \\\\ \\frac{x}{6}-\\frac{{x}^{3}}{1458}, & 0\\le x\\le 9 \\\\ 1, & x>9,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfind $P(1<X\\le 3).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500293 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "2175ed2b-85f5-5f4e-9b21-fd44965b957e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500293 #edb/ref 1074 "We can perform this computation as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(1<X\\le 3) & =P(X\\le 3)-P(X\\le 1) \\\\  & =F(3)-F(1) \\\\  & =(\\frac{3}{6}-\\frac{{3}^{3}}{1458})-(\\frac{1}{6}-\\frac{{1}^{3}}{1458}) \\\\  & =\\frac{230}{729}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500401 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186500408 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500401 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "4853d037-9366-5cfe-b2a6-ea749a958948" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500401 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186500304 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500402 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186500442 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500402 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "4b98f3ca-9d65-5627-9573-4ba0b664bec7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500402 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186500293 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500408 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186500402 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500408 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "62b3bf85-d97a-532c-9a1f-d9d9bafa37cd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500408 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186424886 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500442 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "cc39bcea-e4ea-5193-946b-a894508db75a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592